    card title "My family"

A: How do you say my in Russian? Masha's family photos will show you: it isn't one word.
    draw tom tom_name masha masha_name

    draw ph_mama

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw ph_papa

    draw talk

    draw e_card e_gl

A: Э́то means this is, and it brings a new letter, Э, which says e, as in end; not Е, which says ye.
    highlight talk_1_words talk_3_words part ^Э color #d0865f

B: Now listen to my: моя́ ма́ма, but мой па́па. Two different words for my.
    blocking false

    highlight talk_1_words part моя́ color #b5482e duration 2

    highlight talk_3_words part мой color #2f6b8f duration 2.8

    erase talk e_card e_gl

    draw ph_brat ph_sestra parallel true

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

    draw ph_kot

    draw talk2

    erase talk2 photos

    hide speakers

A: So why мой брат, but моя́ сестра́? Bring back lesson two's three groups: он, она́ and оно́.
    draw h_on h_ona h_ono

    draw b_card b_gl parallel true

A: Брат, brother, starts with a new letter, Б, which says b; it ends in a consonant, like кот, so both are он.
    draw c_brat c_kot

    erase b_card b_gl

B: Ма́ма and сестра́, sister, end in а, so they are она́.
    draw c_mama c_sestra

A: And two things in Masha's home are оно́: окно́, a window, and молоко́, milk.
    draw c_okno c_moloko

    hide h_on h_ona h_ono

A: Now each group gets its own my: он words take мой, она́ words take моя́, and оно́ words take моё.
    draw m_moy m_moya m_moyo pl_0 pl_1 pl_2

B: Listen to the ends: моя́ ма́ма, моё окно́. My picks up the noun's own ending, and мой ends in a consonant, й, like брат and кот.
    blocking false

    highlight m_moya part я$ effect pulse color #b5482e duration 1

    highlight c_mama part а$ effect pulse color #b5482e duration 1

    highlight m_moyo part ё$ effect pulse color #8a5fa8 duration 1

    highlight c_okno part о$ effect pulse color #8a5fa8 duration 2.2

    highlight m_moy part й$ effect pulse color #2f6b8f duration 1.3

    highlight c_brat c_kot part т$ effect pulse color #2f6b8f duration 1.8

A: So which my does па́па take? He ends in а, like ма́ма.
    draw c_papa

    draw papa_ring

B: But a dad is a he, so it's мой па́па: as in lesson two, the meaning wins over the ending.
    blocking false

    highlight m_moy part й$ effect pulse color #2f6b8f duration 2.4

    highlight c_papa color #2f6b8f duration 3.5

    draw phrase

A: Put э́то in front, and you can introduce anyone: э́то моя́ ма́ма, this is my mum. Э́то never changes; only my does.
    blocking false

    highlight phrase part Э́то effect underline color #8f887c duration 2

    highlight phrase part моя́ effect underline color #b5482e duration 2.4

    highlight phrase part Э́то effect underline color #8f887c duration 1.6

    highlight phrase part моя́ effect pulse color #b5482e duration 1.6

    hide boardall phrase

    draw sort

    ask "Put each word under its my: мой, моя́ or моё." on sort store s stage own test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: {s} right on the first try; and ко́фе, remember lesson four, is a he: мой ко́фе.
        wrong: {s} of {s.total} on the first try; ко́фе, remember lesson four, is a he: мой ко́фе.

    erase sort

    draw q_sis

    quiz "Masha points at her sister. Э́то ___ сестра́. Which word fills the gap?" reveal.text "моя́ сестра́" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1
        right: Моя́: сестра́ ends in а, so моя́ сестра́.
        wrong: Look at the last letter of сестра́.
        * мой
        + моя́
        * моё

    erase q_sis reveal_1_stamp

    draw q_dad

    quiz "And her dad: Э́то ___ па́па." reveal.text "мой па́па" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1
        right: Мой: па́па ends in а, but a dad is он, so мой па́па.
        wrong: Forget the last letter this time: is a dad a he or a she?
        + мой
        * моя́
        * моё

    erase q_dad reveal_2_stamp

    draw q_win

    ask "Type my for a window: ___ окно́." answer ["моё","мое"] translit true reveal.text "моё окно́" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЧЫЬЭЯ
        right: Моё: окно́ ends in о, so моё окно́.
        wrong: Окно́ is оно́: which my ends like it?

    erase q_win reveal_3_stamp

    draw q_bro q_bro_ru

    quiz "What does Э́то мой брат mean?" reveal.text "= this is my brother" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 50 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1
        right: This is my brother: э́то, this is; мой брат, my brother.
        wrong: Брат starts with the new letter Б.
        + This is my brother
        * This is my sister
        * My brother is at home

    erase q_bro q_bro_ru reveal_4_stamp

    group fam members ["f1","f2","f3","f4"]
    parallel true

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

    erase fam

    show c_brat c_kot c_papa c_mama c_sestra c_okno c_moloko m_moy m_moya m_moyo papa_ring pl_0 pl_1 pl_2

A: So my in Russian copies its noun: мой for a he, моя́ for a she, моё for an it, and the noun's last letter tells you which, as in lesson two.
    blocking false

    highlight m_moy c_brat c_kot c_papa duration 2.2

    highlight m_moya c_mama c_sestra duration 1.6

    highlight m_moyo c_okno c_moloko duration 2.6

    hide c_brat c_kot c_papa c_mama c_sestra c_okno c_moloko m_moy m_moya m_moyo papa_ring pl_0 pl_1 pl_2

B: And my cat has learnt it too: моё молоко́! Пока́!
    icon end_cat size 150 set twemoji x 400 y 420 or ["cat face"] icon_look picture of cat
    icon end_milk size 130 set twemoji x 600 y 420 or ["milk"] icon_look picture of "glass of milk"
    text end_say "Моё молоко́!" say "Моё молоко!" say_voice b colors {"ё$":"#8a5fa8","о$":"#8a5fa8"} x 500 y 280 font_size 64

